    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22518" root="شعل" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشْعَلُ</span></b>  A horse <i>having the whiteness termed</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُعْلَةٌ</span> (As, S, Mgh, O, K) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَعَلٌ</span> [q. v.]; (Mgh,
K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَعِيلٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَاعِلٌ</span></b> : (O, K:) fem. of
the first <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَعْلَآءُ</span>. (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُرَّةٌ شَعْلَآءُ</span> [<i>A
blaze on a horse's forehead</i> or <i>face</i>] <i>taking in,</i>
i. e. <i>including, one of the eyes.</i> (Mgh, TA.)

